From 4ce9c56e03134680fb98087e48bda04ad9ddad8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:59:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] configs: qs95: persist the DDR quickboot data in SPL

The OEI DDR training data (ddrphy_qb_state at 0x8fe00000) was never
written back to the boot container: neither CONFIG_SPL_IMX_QB nor a
'qb save' anywhere in the environment were present, so the 64 KiB
hold area in flash.bin stayed all-zero and the OEI ran the full DDR
Training flow on every boot, warm reset included. doc/board/nxp/qb.rst
asks for CONFIG_SPL_MMC_WRITE alongside CONFIG_SPL_IMX_QB.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
---
 configs/qs95-5610_defconfig       | 2 ++
 configs/qs95-5610_mfg_defconfig   | 2 ++
 configs/qs95-5610_noenv_defconfig | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/qs95-5610_defconfig b/configs/qs95-5610_defconfig
index 0382400c0e7..75b8871a81a 100644
--- a/configs/qs95-5610_defconfig
+++ b/configs/qs95-5610_defconfig
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ CONFIG_OF_LIBFDT_OVERLAY=y
 CONFIG_SYS_DEVICE_NULLDEV=y
 CONFIG_SYS_MONITOR_LEN=524288
 CONFIG_SPL_MMC=y
+CONFIG_SPL_MMC_WRITE=y
 CONFIG_SPL_SERIAL=y
 CONFIG_SPL_DRIVERS_MISC=y
 CONFIG_SPL_HAVE_INIT_STACK=y
@@ -265,6 +266,7 @@ CONFIG_ARMV8_CRYPTO=y
 
 CONFIG_IMX_SNPS_DDR_PHY_QB_GEN=y
 CONFIG_SAVED_QB_STATE_BASE=0x8fe00000
+CONFIG_SPL_IMX_QB=y
 
 CONFIG_DM_THERMAL=y
 CONFIG_SCMI_THERMAL=y
